{
  "slug": "confidence",
  "name": "Confidence",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Access Confidence feature flags, experiments, and migration tools directly from Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills**, **17 commands** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `analyze-project` (Analyze a user's project and propose a meaningful feature flag change using Confidence), `explore-metric` (Explore and preview metrics for any event or fact table), `instrument-events` (Analyze a project's codebase, identify what events to track alongside the metrics they'd power, create event definitions in…), `migrate-eppo` (Migrate feature flags from Eppo to Confidence SDK), `migrate-optimizely` (Migrate Optimizely to Confidence — users/groups/roles/policies, Flag clients from env SDK keys, flag definitions, and OpenFeature code), `migrate-posthog` (Migrate feature flags from PostHog to Confidence SDK), `migrate-statsig` (Migrate feature flags from Statsig to Confidence SDK), `onboard-confidence` (Create Confidence accounts and onboard users), and 6 more\n- **Commands** (17): `analyze-project` (Analyze a project and propose feature flag changes using Confidence), `explore-metric` (Explore and preview metrics for any event or fact table), `instrument-events` (Analyze a project and instrument event tracking with Confidence), `migrate-eppo` (Migrate feature flags from Eppo to Confidence), `migrate-optimizely-adjust-access` (/migrate-optimizely adjust access — Phase 0: fine-edit the access plan (users, groups, roles, policies, clients)), `migrate-optimizely-adjust-code` (/migrate-optimizely adjust code — Phase 2: fine-edit the code plan (style, resolve mode, transforms, files/flags)), `migrate-optimizely-adjust-flags` (/migrate-optimizely adjust flags — Phase 1: fine-edit the flag plan (scope, Migrate/Skip, client, bucketing, schema, rules)), `migrate-optimizely-execute-access` (/migrate-optimizely execute access — invite users, create groups, and as soon as each person accepts: put them in…), and 9 more\n- **MCP servers** (2): `confidence-flags`, `confidence-docs`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install confidence@claude-plugins-official` from `spotify/confidence-ai-plugins`.",
